<title>JAPAN: Kanro - 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Kanro - 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.17		vs	   17.24</p>
<p> Operating	  322    million    vs	  931    million</p>
<p> Current	    339    million    vs	  841    million</p>
<p> Net		  585    million    vs	  245    million</p>
<p> EPS		   29.96 yen	  vs	   13.49 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kanro Co Ltd is a medium-sized confectionery maker.</p>
